{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0416","name":"商鞅","evidence":["wudi-q-o202","wgc-q0041"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o202-wudi-p0416","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o202"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o053-wudi-p0416","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及商鞅","evidence":["wgc-q0041"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0041","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0c032a6da7eae7e225ce","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛恪围合肥新城，不克，退归。艾言景王曰：“孙权已没，大臣未附；吴名宗大族，皆有部曲〖20〗；阻兵仗势，足以（建）〔违〕命。恪新秉国政，而内无其主；不念抚恤上下以立根基，竞于外事〖21〗，虐用其民；悉国之众，顿于坚城，死者万数，载祸而归。此恪获罪之日也。昔子胥、吴起、商鞅、乐毅皆见任时君〖22〗，主没而败。况恪才非四贤，而不虑不患，其亡可待也。”恪归，果见诛。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o202","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1ecf403c81eacebd9775","layer":"original","quote":"评曰〖1〗：汉末天下大乱，雄豪并起。而袁绍虎视四州〖2〗，强盛莫敌。太祖运筹演谋，鞭挞宇内〖3〗：揽申、商之法术〖4〗，该韩、白之奇策〖5〗；官方授材〖6〗，各因其器；矫情任算，不念旧恶。终能总御皇机〖7〗，克成洪业者，惟其明略最优也〖8〗。抑可谓非常之人〖9〗，超世之杰矣！","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":462,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
